The existing append-only audit architecture remains authoritative for historical security records.

35. REQUEST IDENTITY
Every API request shall receive:
request_id
The request identifier shall propagate through:
API
 ↓
DOMAIN SERVICE
 ↓
JOB
 ↓
WORKER
 ↓
EVENT
