16. Execute authorized worker operation

17. Attempt unauthorized worker operation

18. Verify denial

19. Submit Aria command

20. Verify Aria capability authorization

21. Record security event

22. Revoke credential

23. Verify subsequent request fails

24. Retrieve security audit history
